    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5134" root="جحف" body-key="j">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجتحفهُ</span></b> : see 1, in three places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>He
seized it, took it,</i> or <i>carried it off, by force.</i> (K,
TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>He took it up,</i> namely, the food called
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَريد</span>, <i>with the three fingers.</i> (Sgh, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>He
exhausted it,</i> namely, the water of a well, (K,
TA,) <i>with the hand or with a vessel.</i> (TA.)

